{
    "title": "JJK - Guess the Character",
    "description": "\"The game contains most of the characters in the Jujutsu series.\r\n\r\nThere are three different game modes right now:\r\n\r\n- Hangman mode: Where you will see the character and you need to guess who is it.\r\n- Identify mode: There will be the character name and four different images, you need to guess the right one.\r\n- Quiz mode: There will be a character image and four different character names, you need to guess the right one.\r\n\r\nEach mode has it's own leaderboard where you can score and challenge your friends.\r\n\r\nThe application groups characters so that the most popular ones appear at the beginning and become more complex as you progress through the stages.\r\n\r\nIf you have a gd.games account you can log in and save your score to compete with friends and family!\r\n\r\nSo you can find out who is the main fan of the series.\"",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;The game contains most of the characters in the Jujutsu series.<br><br>There are three different game modes right now:<br><br>- Hangman mode: Where you will see the character and you need to guess who is it.<br>- Identify mode: There will be the character name and four different images, you need to guess the right one.<br>- Quiz mode: There will be a character image and four different character names, you need to guess the right one.<br><br>Each mode has it&#39;s own leaderboard where you can score and challenge your friends.<br><br>The application groups characters so that the most popular ones appear at the beginning and become more complex as you progress through the stages.<br><br>If you have a gd.games account you can log in and save your score to compete with friends and family!<br><br>So you can find out who is the main fan of the series.&quot;",
